   Girling, Robbie D.; Ryalls, James M. W., Univ Reading, Reading, England.
   Girling, Robbie D., Univ Southern Queensland, Toowoomba, Qld, Australia.
   Blande, James D., Univ Eastern Finland, Kuopio, Finland.
