   Kerr, Jacqueline, Univ Calif San Diego, Dept Family \& Prevent Med, San Diego, CA 92103 USA.
   Ersboll, Annette Kjaer, Univ Southern Denmark, Natl Inst Publ Hlth, Copenhagen, Denmark.},
