   Stella, Francesca, Univ Glasgow, Sch Social \& Polit Sci, Sociol, Glasgow, Lanark, Scotland.
   Gawlewicz, Anna, Univ Glasgow, Sch Social \& Polit Sci, Urban Studies, Glasgow, Lanark, Scotland.},
